item_assets/steam/apps/3727410/extras/a3adff298dae2e3bcdaa25f511de79fa.mp4?t=1773846474\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Hang out with up to <strong>12 players\u00a0</strong>in online lobbies, hosted by other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Break into virus-infested programs in <strong>1 to 3 player dungeon raids.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Meet the many eccentric virtual assistants of Bliss!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>All progression is stored locally</strong>, letting you play whenever you'd like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Perform in extracurricular activities, including card games and\u00a0\ud83d\udc1f\u00a0<strong>fishing\u00a0</strong>\ud83d\udc1f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Dog in the Machine"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727410/bfff24aee7d3e5b94b118adb6c7ce0ebe439274c/header.jpg?t=1773846474","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.5Ghz+ Quad Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 2 GB, OpenGL 4.6<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.5Ghz+ Quad Core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 2GB, OpenGL 4.6<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet